== Description ==
An upgraded version of {{PetTooltip|Homunculus}}, increasing profits and periodically granting [[Sources|mana sources]].

Gains experience based on Character Level.

== Pet Abilities ==

Multiplies profits by:
<br><math>L \times P \times 5 + 1</math>


Grants one mana source every:
<br><math>\left\lfloor \frac{S^{0.5}}{P} \right\rceil</math>
<br>seconds (minimum 1),  whose cost does not exceed:
<br><math>M \times 500</math>
<br>''Note: Chooses from sources with at least one manual purchase.''

where:
* <math>L = \text{Pet Level}</math>
* <math>P = \text{Pet Ability Power}</math>
* <math>S = \text{Bought Mana Sources}</math>
* <math>M = \text{All Mana this Realm}</math>

== Experience Gain ==
Gains experience each second, equal to:
<br><math>\left(1 + \frac{L}{100} + F\right) \times M</math>
<br>where:
* <math>L = \text{Character Level}</math>
* <math>F = \text{Fixed Pet XP Bonus}</math>
* <math>M = \text{Pet XP Multiplier}</math>

== Strategy ==
* Like {{PetTooltip|Homunculus}}, its source maxing ability can be used to meet unlock conditions earlier than otherwise possible.
* Combine with {{ItemTooltip|Whiplash}} and {{ItemTooltip|Collar Of Obedience}} to quickly max sources at the start of an Exile.
* From the start of the Exile, buy only one type of mana source. Since its source-granting ability only works on purchased sources (i.e. excludes Red [[Catalysts]]), this is the fastest way to generate a particular mana source. After reaching the target amount, other sources can be purchased.

